  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_0856.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>M&aacute;s de 400 Vespas han tomado a mediod&iacute;a de este s&aacute;bado la Plaza de Espa&ntilde;a, dentro de los actos de la IV concentraci&oacute;n Vespazahar, organizada por el Vespa Club Castell&oacute;n durante todo este fin de semana y que cuenta con la participaci&oacute;n de aficionados de toda Espa&ntilde;a, entre ellos un grupo de l&#39;Antic Vespa Club de Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentraciovespesplespanyaonda/img_0851.jpg\" alt=\"img_0851\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentraciovespesplespanyaonda/img_0852.jpg\" alt=\"img_0852\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentraciovespesplespanyaonda/img_0853.jpg\" alt=\"img_0853\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentraciovespesplespanyaonda/img_0854.jpg\" alt=\"img_0854\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentraciovespesplespanyaonda/img_0855.jpg\" alt=\"img_0855\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentraciovespesplespanyaonda/img_0856.jpg\" alt=\"img_0856\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentraciovespesplespanyaonda/img_0857.jpg\" alt=\"img_0857\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentraciovespesplespanyaonda/img_0858.jpg\" alt=\"img_0858\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfb